# Smart Cheque Blockchain Core - Project Document

## Project Overview

The Blockchain Core is the foundational layer of the Smart Cheque platform, providing secure, transparent, and auditable on-chain execution of payment instruments. This project encompasses the development of a complete blockchain infrastructure including smart contracts, node operations, cross-chain bridges, and supporting services.

---

## 1. BLOCKCHAIN INFRASTRUCTURE

### 1.1 Network Layer Implementation

**Feature: Layer-2 Blockchain Network Setup**
- Sub-feature: Chain Selection and Configuration
  - Evaluate and select optimal L2 solution (Polygon PoS, Optimism, Arbitrum, Solana, Avalanche)
  - Configure network parameters and genesis block
  - Set up validator/sequencer requirements
- Sub-feature: Node Architecture Design
  - Design multi-tier node architecture (Sequencer, Validator, Full, Archive)
  - Define node specifications and resource requirements
  - Create node deployment templates
- Sub-feature: Bridge Infrastructure
  - Implement ERC-20 and native token bridge contracts
  - Set up relayer services for cross-chain proofs
  - Configure bridge security parameters

**Feature: Consensus and Security Implementation**
- Sub-feature: Consensus Mechanism Setup
  - Implement chosen consensus algorithm (Optimistic/zk-Rollup or PoS)
  - Configure fraud proof or validity proof systems
  - Set up block production and validation logic
- Sub-feature: Governance Framework
  - Deploy on-chain governance contracts
  - Implement protocol upgrade mechanisms
  - Set up validator management system
- Sub-feature: Security and Slashing
  - Implement slashing mechanics for validator misbehavior
  - Set up staking requirements and penalties
  - Configure transaction finality guarantees

### 1.2 Smart Contract Development

**Feature: Core Smart Contract Suite**
- Sub-feature: SmartChequeFactory Contract
  - Develop contract deployment functionality
  - Implement cheque registry and tracking
  - Add event emission for cheque creation
- Sub-feature: SmartChequeEscrow Contract
  - Implement fund locking and release mechanisms
  - Develop milestone state management
  - Add dispute handling capabilities
- Sub-feature: ObligationRegistry Contract
  - Create obligation storage and mapping system
  - Implement oracle feed integration points
  - Add obligation verification logic
- Sub-feature: DisputeManager Contract
  - Develop multi-tier dispute resolution system
  - Implement escalation path enforcement
  - Add resolution outcome execution

**Feature: Contract Security and Upgradeability**
- Sub-feature: Proxy System Implementation
  - Implement UUPS proxy pattern for upgradeability
  - Set up admin role restrictions
  - Configure timelock-controlled upgrades
- Sub-feature: Access Control System
  - Implement role-based permissions (OWNER, ADMIN, ORACLE roles)
  - Set up multi-signature requirements
  - Add emergency pause functionality
- Sub-feature: Security Auditing
  - Conduct static analysis (Slither, MythX)
  - Perform formal verification of core contracts
  - Execute third-party security audits

