## Project Dependencies and Constraints

### Technical Dependencies
- Ethereum mainnet for L1 operations
- Selected L2 solution (Polygon, Optimism, etc.)
- Cloud infrastructure (AWS/GCP/Azure)
- Third-party oracle providers
- HSM providers for key management

### Resource Constraints
- Development team size and expertise
- Infrastructure budget and scaling costs
- Security audit timeline and availability
- Regulatory compliance requirements
- Integration complexity with external systems

### Risk Factors
- Smart contract vulnerabilities
- Oracle manipulation risks
- Cross-chain bridge security
- Scalability limitations
- Regulatory changes
- Third-party service dependencies

